{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b95731d4ad56c5e7b82f58f2466bed6aeee113d533936ea1c26385f8c7fe1ecd", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "0e25f7c92419f297f78769bcf9c086e89882a62b69e45b30db20e62cb25b22c7", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　お疲れさまです……\nあっ、音無先輩！　それに社長さんも。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！辛苦了……\n啊，音无前辈！还有社长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1002_president", "source_sha256": "5ac1e16d637cfdad9fca5300432331aca08d30c59334a8555ee3be82b2f138b4", "ja": "やあ青羽君、今日はよろしく！　いやはや、\nいてもたってもいられずに、駆け付けてしまったよ。", "zh": "哎呀青羽君，今天就拜托你了！哎呀，\n我实在坐立不安，就直接赶过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "d376719b621e5512b8551a566c47c9ee23f7784479a51c6b98f3f54d6f845935", "ja": "なにしろ、『聖ミリオン女学園』の新作ですからね！\n私もずっと楽しみにしていたんです。", "zh": "毕竟是《圣百万女学园》的新作嘛！我也一直都特别期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "0d6655b917a8e544c31c5ff956122df3c7c0ef40ed7edac8f8644aca7783edf1", "ja": "しかも今回は、前作までの一気見もあるっていうし、\n期待も高まっちゃって……予習はバッチリです♪", "zh": "而且这次听说还可以一口气重温前作，\n让我更加期待了……功课已经做得足足的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1005_president", "source_sha256": "e64039ca2a78a6b6800e9293527d2f642c4dd5d116da8b3020837667a4bee6a8", "ja": "私も家でDVDを見直してきたから、受け入れ態勢は\nバッチリだよ！　新作、どんとこいだ。", "zh": "我也在家重新看了DVD，所以已经做好充分准备啦！新作尽管放马过来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4c8170fe76eb2c119236d515f65fa5ef14efc6bea2e9c3106d9503b521454fe9", "ja": "そんなに楽しみにして貰えるとありがたいですね。\n是非楽しんでいってください！", "zh": "您能这么期待，真是太好了。请尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "66bf7738091429a6ee90fe0bd99d151c226fca12290eb6986ea50720b1587ff3", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　すみません、\n開場前に色々と確認してもらいたいことが……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！不好意思，\n开场前有些事情想请您确认一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "12818c38b2eb9a2383ca7b8fca8b8fd033cbf0dc3c683f5e49f204a5f0691817", "ja": "ああ、すみません。今日は青羽さんと、\nなんだかすれ違っちゃってましたね。", "zh": "啊，抱歉。今天好像和青羽小姐一直没碰上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d19d73cd3a0f401e46cdb81bf35e6d976fef30083c2f0c44162b54cc7fd3935a", "ja": "非常口の開錠、ポスターの入れ替えとチラシの補充、\n音響設備等のチェックはやっておきました。", "zh": "紧急出口的开锁、海报更换和传单补充，还有音响设备等的检查，我都已经做好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "1b5929a85d5f330a481cd0c004306321f969756a238307e1ab80adddc62cc797", "ja": "あ……ふふふ♪　ありがとうございます。\nそれで大丈夫です！", "zh": "啊……呵呵♪ 谢谢您。\n这样就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "bf6a6b09cea187d9c7ad96ae477a3d2721810c89a6bd5dc3299ad5f0f0f734c5", "ja": "あらっ、なんだか二人とも、信頼し合う同僚\nって感じで、羨ましくなっちゃいますね。ふふっ。", "zh": "哎呀，总觉得你们两位就像是彼此信赖的同事一样，让人羡慕呢。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "184d41150670caa350403ce6149ff217ff475774669549f85df9c32dbedadc5b", "ja": "うむ！　過ごした時間が、信頼を築いたんだろうね。\n頼もしい限りだ。", "zh": "嗯！共同度过的时光，想必建立起了信任吧。\n真是太可靠了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "1602f52f8ea22da922e89337499d433e286278480dd167d11070c5a2cfd6435d", "ja": "えへへ……♪　あ、そうだ。舞台挨拶のキャストも、\nそろそろスタンバイしてもらった方がいいですよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪啊，对了。舞台致辞的演员们，也差不多该请他们准备了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8e15fafb7c262548325184350cc3156da4c157b0e73cf0d33d4cb6937f0dd7b6", "ja": "そうですね、声を掛けてきます。\nじゃあ、そろそろ移動しておきましょう！", "zh": "是啊，我去叫她们过来。\n那么，我们也差不多该过去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "102022b91ce6318f9103eb6e5538ff3e6d13cb39a2d8e6d747d218fd42a2f8ca", "ja": "本日は『聖ミリオン女学園』新作試写会、および\nシリーズ上映会にお越し頂き、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "感谢各位今天前来参加《圣百万女学园》新作试映会及系列放映会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "9595daba5a2583c10aa3b34389c03898fe7dd3bde6ad5de74e91cd8061f9175e", "ja": "開演に先立ちまして、キャスト達による舞台挨拶が\nあります。どうぞ、盛大な拍手でお迎えください！", "zh": "在开场之前，演员们还会登台致辞。\n请大家用热烈的掌声欢迎她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1017_se", "source_sha256": "34cea6b7977fb6fd350e8da29fa632ceaa88958e5c75f73dee85b9446054fa5c", "ja": "ワァーッ！　パチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "哇——！啪啪啪啪啪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "c8831a2ab60b41825dfdf78a6bc18f8534dcf1e534d5fe08107a503d0e393ba8", "ja": "みんな、今日は来てくれてありがとー！\n最後まで楽しんでってくれよな！　あ、永吉昴でした！", "zh": "大家，今天谢谢你们过来——！\n一定要开心到最后哦！啊，我是永吉昴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "8b4f4f1f582ddedb02299a73ec6756486a245aa8c20f873fc091664357486d75", "ja": "如月千早です。本日はありがとうございます。\n私達ジャスミン姉妹の物語、どうぞご覧ください。", "zh": "我是如月千早。非常感谢大家今天能来。\n请大家好好欣赏，我们茉莉花姐妹的故事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "88ff48d7e00f3f2d78acef4255c6a9ca365e0fe0cc7ae7eb5111f82860aad251", "ja": "篠宮可憐、です……。ふ、普段の私とは全然違う、\n堂々とした役なので……み、見てください……！", "zh": "我是篠宫可怜……。这、这是和我平时完全不同的、威风凛凛的角色……请、请大家看看……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "50d45bead82fba2a68a4eda3143d096cc05edfff63005c2983cf19fa17687791", "ja": "こんにちは！　ミス・デイジー役、高山紗代子です！\nこの日を迎えることができて、感無量です！", "zh": "你好！我是饰演“黛西小姐”的高山纱代子！\n能够迎来这一天，我感慨万千！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "7ba0c66624dbae9f83ca6de32235b163664ba4f3b96b8e11d7ed834fca54b205", "ja": "たまきだぞ！　監督が、たまきのお芝居をほめて\nくれたんだ～。早くみんなにも見てほしいな、くふふ♪", "zh": "我是环！导演夸奖了环的演技哦～真想让大家也早点看看，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "cb7aff95578e0dbdb4f5d96ffa64f7b5f44340490db6d3586cfcddd1ae32ec78", "ja": "紗代子お姉さまの妹、野々原茜でーす！\nみんなは今日、茜ちゃんの演技に涙する……（確定）！", "zh": "我是纱代子姐姐的妹妹，野野原茜！今天大家都会为小茜的演技感动落泪……（确定）！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1024_102mis", "source_sha256": "e8e5a5904f346db26db4599f03713c1cd04542bee466b4d396ff38a57521741e", "ja": "みなさん、ありがとうございました！\nそれでは、上映をお楽しみください！", "zh": "各位，非常感谢！\n那么，请大家尽情欣赏放映吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_intro_1025_se", "source_sha256": "34cea6b7977fb6fd350e8da29fa632ceaa88958e5c75f73dee85b9446054fa5c", "ja": "ワァーッ！　パチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "哇——！啪啪啪啪啪……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
